{
    "name": "L3 - Skill: Meeting Scheduler",
    "description": "Schedules meetings and checks availability via Notion Calendar",
    "nodes": [
        {
            "parameters": {
                "inputSource": "passthrough"
            },
            "name": "Scheduler Input",
            "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeWorkflowTrigger",
            "typeVersion": 1,
            "position": [
                100,
                300
            ],
            "id": "scheduler-input"
        },
        {
            "parameters": {
                "model": "models/gemini-2.0-flash",
                "options": {
                    "temperature": 0.2
                }
            },
            "name": "Scheduler LLM",
            "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatGoogleGemini",
            "typeVersion": 1,
            "position": [
                300,
                300
            ],
            "id": "scheduler-llm"
        },
        {
            "parameters": {
                "promptType": "define",
                "text": "You are Fikanova's meeting scheduler. Parse this meeting request.\n\nRequest: {{$json.message}}\n\nExtract:\n- Meeting title\n- Proposed date/time (convert relative dates like 'tomorrow' to actual dates)\n- Duration (default 30 min)\n- Attendees\n- Meeting type (call, video, in-person)\n- Priority\n\nToday is: {{new Date().toISOString().split('T')[0]}}\n\nRespond with JSON:\n```json\n{\n  \"title\": \"meeting title\",\n  \"date\": \"YYYY-MM-DD\",\n  \"time\": \"HH:MM\",\n  \"duration_minutes\": 30,\n  \"attendees\": [\"list of attendees\"],\n  \"type\": \"video|call|in-person\",\n  \"priority\": \"high|normal|low\",\n  \"notes\": \"any additional context\"\n}\n```"
            },
            "name": "Scheduler Prompt",
            "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
            "typeVersion": 1.4,
            "position": [
                300,
                300
            ],
            "id": "scheduler-prompt",
            "inputs": [
                {
                    "node": "Scheduler LLM",
                    "type": "ai_language_model",
                    "index": 0
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "parameters": {
                "jsCode": "const response = items[0].json.text || items[0].json.response || '{}';\ntry {\n  items[0].json.meeting = JSON.parse(response.replace(/```json\\n?|```/g, '').trim());\n} catch (e) {\n  items[0].json.meeting = {\n    title: 'Meeting',\n    date: new Date().toISOString().split('T')[0],\n    time: '10:00',\n    duration_minutes: 30,\n    attendees: [],\n    type: 'video',\n    priority: 'normal'\n  };\n}\nreturn items;"
            },
            "name": "Parse Meeting",
            "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
            "typeVersion": 2,
            "position": [
                500,
                300
            ],
            "id": "scheduler-parse"
        },
        {
            "parameters": {
                "method": "POST",
                "url": "https://api.notion.com/v1/pages",
                "sendHeaders": true,
                "headerParameters": {
                    "parameters": [
                        {
                            "name": "Authorization",
                            "value": "Bearer {{ $env.NOTION_API_KEY }}"
                        },
                        {
                            "name": "Notion-Version",
                            "value": "2022-06-28"
                        },
                        {
                            "name": "Content-Type",
                            "value": "application/json"
                        }
                    ]
                },
                "sendBody": true,
                "specifyBody": "json",
                "jsonBody": "={\n  \"parent\": { \"database_id\": \"{{ $env.NOTION_DATABASE_CALENDAR }}\" },\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"Name\": { \"title\": [{ \"text\": { \"content\": \"{{ $json.meeting.title }}\" }}] },\n    \"Date\": { \"date\": { \"start\": \"{{ $json.meeting.date }}T{{ $json.meeting.time }}:00\" }},\n    \"Type\": { \"select\": { \"name\": \"{{ $json.meeting.type }}\" }}\n  }\n}",
                "options": {}
            },
            "name": "Create in Notion",
            "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
            "typeVersion": 4.2,
            "position": [
                700,
                300
            ],
            "id": "scheduler-notion"
        },
        {
            "parameters": {
                "jsCode": "return [{\n  json: {\n    success: true,\n    message: `Meeting scheduled: ${items[0].json.meeting?.title} on ${items[0].json.meeting?.date} at ${items[0].json.meeting?.time}`,\n    meeting: items[0].json.meeting\n  }\n}];"
            },
            "name": "Scheduler Response",
            "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
            "typeVersion": 2,
            "position": [
                900,
                300
            ],
            "id": "scheduler-response"
        }
    ],
    "connections": {
        "Scheduler Input": {
            "main": [
                [
                    {
                        "node": "Scheduler Prompt",
                        "type": "main",
                        "index": 0
                    }
                ]
            ]
        },
        "Scheduler Prompt": {
            "main": [
                [
                    {
                        "node": "Parse Meeting",
                        "type": "main",
                        "index": 0
                    }
                ]
            ]
        },
        "Parse Meeting": {
            "main": [
                [
                    {
                        "node": "Create in Notion",
                        "type": "main",
                        "index": 0
                    }
                ]
            ]
        },
        "Create in Notion": {
            "main": [
                [
                    {
                        "node": "Scheduler Response",
                        "type": "main",
                        "index": 0
                    }
                ]
            ]
        }
    },
    "settings": {
        "executionOrder": "v1"
    }
}